<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He knows your deepest thought,</l><l>Your every situation.</l><l>He understands your heart,</l><l>He knows your history.</l><l>There’s nothing in His way,</l><l>He’s just waiting for you to say</l><l>“Lord Jesus, my wandering heart</l><l>I give to Thee.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
